                Shopify for Algeria
              </span>
            </div>

            <h3 class="mt-2.5 text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 group-hover:text-blue-500 transition-colors">
              StoresDZ
